bai (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add provider selection with Anthropic and OpenAI backends.
  * Harden Anthropic response parsing.
  * Refactor internals into focused modules and expand CLI behavior tests.
  * Publish bai as version 0.3.0.
  * Optional clipboard integration remains external: install `xclip`
    or `wl-clipboard` if you want automatic copy-to-clipboard support.

